## 2. Email Verification on Signup (Gmail SMTP)

### How It Works

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as FastAPI
    participant GM as Gmail SMTP
    participant R as Redis

    U->>FE: Fills signup form, clicks "Create Account"
    FE->>BE: POST /auth/register
    BE->>BE: Create user (is_email_verified = false)
    BE->>BE: Generate verification token (UUID)
    BE->>R: Store token → user_id (TTL: 24 hours)
    BE->>GM: Send email with verification link
    GM->>U: Email: "Click to verify your email"
    BE->>FE: 201 Created (user object)
    FE->>FE: Show "Check your email" page
    U->>FE: Clicks link in email
    FE->>BE: GET /auth/verify-email?token=abc123
    BE->>R: Look up token → user_id
    BE->>BE: Set is_email_verified = true
    BE->>FE: Redirect to /login with success message
```

### Proposed Changes

#### [MODIFY] [config.py](file:///e:/Projects/FYP-PROJECT-UPDATED/fyp_SLM-/backend/app/core/config.py)
Add Gmail SMTP settings:
```python
# Email (Gmail SMTP)
SMTP_HOST: str = "smtp.gmail.com"
SMTP_PORT: int = 587
SMTP_USER: str = ""          # your.email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD: str = ""      # Gmail App Password (NOT your login password)
SMTP_FROM_NAME: str = "SLM Studio"
```

#### [MODIFY] [.env.example](file:///e:/Projects/FYP-PROJECT-UPDATED/fyp_SLM-/.env.example)
Add SMTP section:
```env
